notreal.OS: Nothing Phone (1) device tree changes

- rear ultra-wide S5KJN1: 24 MHz MCLK, 700 MHz link frequency
- main camera Sony IMX766 on CSIPHY3 (C-PHY, 3 trios) with its power rails
- USB-C: L2B regulator at 3.072 V (USB host + DAC power)
- Glyph: AW21018 LED controller
- WCD9385 mic bias, main microphone
- voice calls: q6voice (MVM/CVS/CVP) + VoiceMMode1 DAI link

